  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "TinyEvents.PostgreSql.AdoNet 0.1.0-alpha.3\n\n      Added\n      - Forward-only built-in PostgreSQL migrations with strict history and checksums.\n      - Session-scoped advisory locking, timeout, cancellation, and concurrency safety.\n      - Existing alpha outbox baselining without recreating the table.\n      - Structured migration logging and public MigrateTinyEventsAsync support.\n\n      Ownership\n      - Migration execution reuses UseWorkerConnectionFactory and disposes its dedicated connection.\n      - Application publishing connections and transactions remain caller-owned.\n\n      Compatibility\n      - Early alpha / active development.\n      - Upgrade every TinyEvents package in the application to alpha.3 together.",
